{
  "requirement": "The Habeas Codicem book MUST configure mdBook's Git repository link for `nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem` and its page edit links for the `main` branch.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "structural: The requirement is a configuration obligation. The Habeas Codicem book `MUST configure` mdBook's Git repository link for `nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem`, and its page edit links for the `main` branch. The only structural obligation is that these settings exist in the book configuration, since mdBook reads them from there. An alternative that produced the same links without setting these keys would not configure mdBook's settings as the text requires.\n\nThe two roots do this:\n- `book.toml#table[output.habeas.html]/pair[git-repository-url]` sets `https://github.com/nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem`, which is the repository link.\n- `book.toml#table[output.habeas.html]/pair[edit-url-template]` sets `https://github.com/nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem/edit/main/{path}`, which is the edit link for the `main` branch.\n\nBoth keys sit in the `output.habeas.html` table. That table belongs to the `output.habeas` renderer, which is declared in `book.toml#table[output.habeas]/pair[command]`. I did not read the renderer's code, so I assumed it passes the `html` table to mdBook's HTML renderer. No other structural obligation is stated: the text names no library, type, signature, or delegation. The roots therefore cover everything that needs implementation evidence.\n\nbehavioral: The requirement has two obligations. The book must configure mdBook's Git repository link for `nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem`. The book must also configure page edit links for the `main` branch.\n\n`tests/repository.rs#fn[book_links_to_the_repository_and_main_branch_edit_pages]` parses the real `book.toml`. It reads `output.habeas.html`, which matches the book's renderer table `table[output.habeas.html]`. The `output.habeas` renderer is the one the book configures. The test makes two exact assertions on that table:\n\n- `git-repository-url` equals `https://github.com/nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem`.\n- `edit-url-template` equals `https://github.com/nikomatsakis/habeas-codicem/edit/main/{path}`.\n\nThese assertions cover the repository identity and the `main` branch. A wrong repository, a wrong branch, or a missing key would make the test fail. No other obligation or boundary case is stated.",
